config BR2_PACKAGE_FULLHAN_MEDIA_FH8626V100
	bool "FH8626V100 proprietary media kernel runtime"
	depends on BR2_arm
	help
	  Pinned proprietary FH8626V100 media kernel modules and ARC firmware.

	  Active OpenIPC source branches do not store these binary artifacts.
	  Buildroot downloads the hardware-proven payloads from an immutable
	  archive commit and verifies every file with SHA-256 before install.

	  This package provides only the still-unreplaced kernel/ARC runtime:
	  VMM, XBUS RPC, media_process, ISP, H.264 encoder, JPEG, BGM and
	  gpio_wave. Sensor/MIPI/userspace compatibility is owned separately.

	  https://github.com/ArthurKoba/openipc-firmware
